# Brand Guidelines: AdaptiveAI

## Brand Name
**AdaptiveAI**

## Brand Purpose (1–2 lines)
AdaptiveAI provides real-time, adaptive fraud detection for digital banking by combining deep learning with graph intelligence and producing explainable decisions.

## Brand Personality
- Trustworthy
- Security-first
- Calm and precise
- Futuristic but professional
- Data-driven and transparent

## Core Brand Promises
- **Real-time monitoring** of banking transactions
- **Adaptive learning** to keep up with evolving fraud patterns
- **Graph intelligence** to reveal hidden relationships and fraud networks
- **Explainability by design** to increase trust and enable review

## Visual Identity
### Color System
- **Primary:** Deep Indigo / Purple (dark, premium, secure)
- **Accent:** Electric Cyan (signals intelligence, highlights key insights)
- **Backgrounds:** Dark gradients (reduce noise, elevate focus)
- **Contrast:** High contrast for readability on projected screens

### Design Style
- Minimal clutter
- Strong hierarchy (big headings, short bullets)
- Plenty of negative space
- “Security + intelligence” feel through subtle network/graph motifs

### Motifs / Imagery Direction (Text-only)
- Connected nodes and edges (graphs)
- Streaming lines (real-time data)
- Digital shields (protection)
- Abstract network patterns (fraud rings, relationships)

## Typography Vibe (Tool-Agnostic)
- Bold, modern headings
- Clean body text
- Short punchy bullets instead of long paragraphs

## Voice & Tone
### Voice
- Clear
- Confident
- Technical but accessible

### Tone
- Direct and factual
- Avoids exaggeration
- Emphasizes verification and evidence

## Messaging Rules
### Preferred Verbs
Use strong verbs such as:
- detect
- adapt
- flag
- explain
- protect
- trace
- uncover
- validate

### Must-Emphasize Themes
- Real-time streaming detection (not batch)
- Evolving fraud patterns
- Unified framework (AI + graph)
- Explainability and trust

### Avoid
- Buzzwords without definition
- Unsupported performance numbers (accuracy/recall/latency) unless explicitly measured
- Overpromising like “stops all fraud” or “zero false positives”

## Approved One-Liners (Pick One)
- “AdaptiveAI detects fraud in real time and explains why.”
- “Real-time fraud detection powered by adaptive AI and graph intelligence.”
- “Uncover fraud patterns faster with explainable, adaptive detection.”

## Slide Writing Style
- One idea per slide
- Max 4–6 bullets per slide
- Highlight keywords with consistent emphasis (caps or bold, but not both excessively)
- Keep technical terms consistent across the deck (Kafka, Spark, Graph Analysis, Explainable Output)